---
import { SITE } from '@/config';
import Page from '@/layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Disclaimer"
  description={`${SITE.name} publishes general information about Indian banking rules. It is not financial, legal or tax advice.`}
  path="/disclaimer"
  lede="Read this before acting on anything here."
>
  <h2>This is information, not advice</h2>
  <p>
    Everything on {SITE.name} is general information about how Indian banking rules work. It is not
    financial advice, legal advice, tax advice or investment advice, and it does not take account of
    your particular circumstances. We are not your adviser and no relationship is created by your
    reading this site.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before acting on anything here, confirm it with your bank, or with a qualified professional —
    a chartered accountant for tax, a lawyer for legal exposure, a SEBI-registered adviser for
    investments.
  </p>

  <h2>Rules change</h2>
  <p>
    RBI circulars, NPCI procedures, bureau policies and bank terms change, sometimes with little
    notice. We date every page and list its sources, but a page can be out of date between reviews.
    <strong>Where this site and a current RBI circular disagree, the circular is correct.</strong>
  </p>

  <h2>Banks differ in practice</h2>
  <p>
    A rule that binds every bank is still applied inconsistently by individual branches and call
    centres. Timelines here are what the rules require, not a promise about what your bank will do.
  </p>

  <h2>No affiliation</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is independent. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or acting for the Reserve
    Bank of India, NPCI, any bank, any credit bureau or any government body. Names and trade marks
    belong to their owners and are used only to identify the institution being discussed.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    We link to third-party sites, including official portals and commercial products. We do not
    control them and are not responsible for their content, accuracy or privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to be accurate and we correct errors when we learn of them. To the extent permitted
    by law, we accept no liability for loss arising from reliance on this site. You act on this
    information at your own risk.
  </p>

  <h2>Beware of impersonation</h2>
  <p>
    We will never telephone you, never ask for an OTP, account number, card number, PIN or password,
    and never offer to recover your money for a fee. Anyone doing so while using our name is
    committing fraud. Report it to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and to
    <a href="https://cybercrime.gov.in" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">cybercrime.gov.in</a>.
  </p>
</Page>
